  "source_findings": [
    "hub has per-identity typed_last_task and persistent owner_max_epoch; no last_event_seq",
    "actual LPV transport owns last_event_seq, persists across ordinary request/cancel and may consume trusted rejected sequence",
    "TaskReservation is separate from committed last_task_id; retire requires exactly last_task_id+1",
    "lifecycle currently derives count from last_task_id difference; imported checkpoint predecessor and actual retirement delta must remain distinguishable",
    "full_begin_request resets task allocator/counters but preserves provenance and producer highwater; cannot be used at same-request checkpoint",
    "program owns persistent action_high_water; executor does not become ordinal allocator"
  ],
  "choice": "readonly finite checkpoint bounds from sole shell, v2 1024B16beat, one source/one target; diagnostic-only with continuous real request admission and complete safe prelude",
